<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo adds 750 mln marks to three-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo adds 750 mln marks to three-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by 750 million marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Dresdner Bank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank, Commerzbank, ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and UBS said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT AG</p>
<p> AMT    *1.75 BLN DEM COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    08.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.8925   PAY DATE  **02.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.1375    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL 1.0 BLN DEM LAUNCHED 31.OCT.96</p>
<p>	     **PLUS 24 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.1375    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 1131</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
